            ^"Duration" STRING "Sun"
            ^"Target" STRING "Structure"
            ^"Effect Design" STRING "(Effect: Base 4, +1 Touch,+2 Sun, +3 Structure, +3 Size; +1 lvls for 2 uses a day, +3 lvls for Environmental Trigger (sunrise/ sunset))"
            ^"Printed Effect Line" STRING "ReHe 49 Pen +0, constant effect R: Touch, D: Sun, T: Structure"
            ^"Source" STRING "Magi of Hermes"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 41
