            ^"Range" STRING "Touch"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Momentary"
            ^"Target" STRING "Circle"
            ^"Effect Design" STRING "(Base 15, +1 Touch, +3 Size, +10 lvls Unlimited uses +3 lvls Linked Trigger)"
            ^"Printed Effect Line" STRING "ReHe 48 Pen +0, unlimited uses R: Touch, D: Momentary, T: Circle"
            ^"Source" STRING "Magi of Hermes"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 43
        }
        DESCRIPTION "When the right mental command is made, the enchanted ring of stones moves the gigantic wicker basket carriage 50 paces in some direction. The destination is set when the enchantment is put down.\n\n(Base 15, +1 Touch, +3 Size, +10 lvls Unlimited uses +3 lvls Linked Trigger)"
    }

